<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style/style.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style/houserules.css" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"
    />
    <title>CENDO - Houserules</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main>
      <section class="houserules">
        <h1>Houserules</h1>

        <p class="intro">
          By entering the CENDO event site, you automatically agree to our house rules and general terms and conditions.
          These rules are established to ensure the safety, atmosphere, and overall experience remain as pleasant as possible for everyone.
        </p>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>1. Age & Identification</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>The minimum age for entry is 18 years.</li>
            <li>A valid ID is required and may be checked upon entry (and during the event).</li>
            <li>If there is any doubt about age, entry may be denied without refund.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>2. Entry & Safety</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Entry is always at your own risk.</li>
            <li>CENDO reserves the right to refuse or remove visitors from the premises without refund of the admission fee.</li>
            <li>Visitors may be searched upon entry and during the event. Camera surveillance and detection equipment may also be used.</li>
            <li>Persons visibly under the influence of alcohol or other substances may be denied entry.</li>
            <li>Violation of the rules may result in removal from the premises and, if necessary, involvement of the police.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>3. Following Instructions</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Always follow instructions given by the organization, security, first aid staff, and other CENDO personnel.</li>
            <li>In case of emergencies or incidents, instructions must be followed immediately.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>4. Respect & Behavior</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Treat other visitors and staff with respect.</li>
            <li>Racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, intimidation, aggression, or any form of discrimination or (sexual) harassment will not be tolerated.</li>
            <li>Do you feel unsafe or uncomfortable? Report this immediately to our staff.</li>
            <li>Keep your shirt on during the event.</li>
            <li>Public urination is not allowed.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>5. Alcohol & Drugs</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>It is prohibited to possess, use, or distribute hard drugs, pills, powders, liquids, nitrous oxide (N2O), or other illegal substances.</li>
            <li>Soft drugs are also not allowed unless explicitly stated otherwise per edition.</li>
            <li>If hard drugs are found, immediate removal will follow and the police may be involved.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>6. Prohibited Items</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Weapons, fireworks, or objects that can be used as weapons</li>
            <li>Glassware, cans, or (plastic) bottles</li>
            <li>Outside food and drinks</li>
            <li>Professional photo, film, video, or audio equipment without prior permission</li>
            <li>Selfie sticks</li>
            <li>Large flags or inflatable objects</li>
            <li>Umbrellas</li>
            <li>Laser pointers</li>
            <li>Confetti, graffiti, or other materials that may cause damage</li>
            <li>Face-covering masks (except medical face masks)</li>
            <li>Clothing or expressions with offensive texts/symbols</li>
            <li>Club-related motorcycle gear or full-color football club clothing</li>
            <li>CENDO reserves the right to refuse other items deemed unsafe or inappropriate.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>7. Safety on Site</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Crowd surfing and climbing on structures, trees, or other objects is not allowed.</li>
            <li>Making fires is prohibited.</li>
            <li>Swimming is only allowed when explicitly indicated and only within designated areas and times.</li>
            <li>Smoking and vaping are only allowed in designated outdoor areas.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>8. Privacy & Media</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Respect each other’s privacy. Ask for permission before visibly filming or photographing others.</li>
            <li>Professional recordings are only allowed with written permission from CENDO.</li>
            <li>Photos and videos may be taken during the event for promotional purposes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>9. Commercial Activities</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>It is not permitted to carry out commercial activities without written permission from CENDO, including promotion, sales, or distribution of goods or flyers.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rule">
          <h3>10. Liability</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>CENDO, the venue, and involved parties cannot be held liable for loss, theft, injury, or any form of material or immaterial damage.</li>
            <li>Please use lockers for valuable belongings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p class="outro">
          We count on everyone’s cooperation to make this a safe, respectful, and unforgettable edition together.<br />
          Thank you for your understanding and enjoy CENDO!
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  </body>
</html>